img = Image.fromarray(img)
img.save("16bitTiff.tiff")
```

This creates a 16-bit grayscale image (16-bit TIFF) with a constant value of 32767 (the maximum value of a 16-bit image) and saves it to the current directory as `16bitTiff.tiff`.

## Load the Image

